license: MIT
abstract: 'Analysis code and processed data accompanying the study "FDA Predetermined Change Control Plans
  for AI-Enabled Medical Devices: Manufacturer Experience". Five Jupyter notebooks analyze the post-submission
  survey, pre-submission survey, survey coding reliability, interview domain counts and agreement, and
  FDA authorization census. The package includes eleven CSV inputs and instructions for reproducing twelve
  result tables. The software and its execution documentation are licensed under MIT; the data and data
  documentation are licensed under CC BY 4.0. See LICENSE for the component scopes.'
